{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25023","headline":"与孟郊洛北野泉上煎茶 · 刘言史","name":"与孟郊洛北野泉上煎茶","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"粉细越笋芽，野煎寒溪滨。\n恐乖灵草性，触事皆手亲。\n敲石取鲜火，撇泉避腥鳞。\n荧荧爨风铛，拾得坠巢薪。\n洁色既爽别，浮氲亦殷懃。\n以兹委曲静，求得正味真。\n宛如摘山时，自歠指下春。\n湘瓷泛轻花，涤尽昏渴神。\n此游惬醒趣，可以话高人。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘言史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25023.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25023","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}